ent-DrinkLemonLimeCan = Smite 罐 | Smite can
    .desc = 你想要的是「柳橙」，結果卻給了你「檸檬-萊姆」。 | You wanted ORANGE. It gave you Lemon-Lime.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkLemonLimeCranberryCan = Smite 蔓越莓 罐 | Smite Cranberry can
    .desc = 大家想來一杯「Smite 蔓越莓」嗎？深受各地管理員喜愛。請適量飲用。節慶限定款！ | Y'all want a Smite Cranberry? Beloved by administrators everywhere. Drink in moderation. A limited run for the holidays!
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkGrapeCan = 葡萄汽水 罐 | grape soda can
    .desc = 一款帶有葡萄風味、呈深紫色的甜味飲料。 | Sweetened drink with a grape flavor and a deep purple color.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkRootBeerCan = 根啤酒 罐 | root beer can
    .desc = 那款美味的根啤酒，現在推出方便攜帶的罐裝版啦！ | Some of that tasty root beer goodness, now in a portable can!
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkSodaWaterCan = 蘇打水 罐 | soda water can
    .desc = 蘇打水。何不來一杯蘇格蘭威士忌加蘇打水呢？ | Soda water. Why not make a scotch and soda?
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkSpaceMountainWindCan = 太空太陽風 罐 | Space Solar Wind can
    .desc = 就像太陽風一樣，直衝而過，穿透你的身心。 | Blows right through you like a solar wind.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkSpaceUpCan = Space-Up 罐 | Space-Up can
    .desc = 嚐起來就像是嘴裡發生了船體破裂一樣。 | Tastes like a hull breach in your mouth.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkSolDryCan = Sol Dry 罐 | Sol Dry can
    .desc = 來自外太空的甘薑汽水！ | Sweet ginger soda from outer space!
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkStarkistCan = Starkist 罐 | Starkist can
    .desc = 液態的星辰滋味。還有，一點點鮪魚……？ | The taste of a star in liquid form. And, a bit of tuna...?
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkTonicWaterCan = 通寧水 罐 | tonic water can
    .desc = 奎寧的味道有點怪，但至少能預防「太空瘧疾」。 | Quinine tastes funny, but at least it'll keep that Space Malaria away.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkFourteenLokoCan = Fourteen Loko 罐 | Fourteen Loko can
    .desc = MBO 已提醒船員，飲用「Fourteen Loko」可能導致癲癇發作、失明、醉酒，甚至死亡。請理性飲酒。 | The MBO has advised crew members that consumption of Fourteen Loko may result in seizures, blindness, drunkeness, or even death. Please Drink Responsibly.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkChangelingStingCan = 變形者之刺 罐 | Changeling Sting can
    .desc = 你抿了一小口，隨即感到一股灼熱感…… | You take a tiny sip and feel a burning sensation...
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkDrGibbCan = 吉布博士 罐 | Dr. Gibb can
    .desc = 由 42 種不同風味精心調配而成的美味組合。 | A delicious blend of 42 different flavours.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkNukieCan = 血紅啤酒 罐 | Blood-red Brew can
    .desc = 一款由「辛迪加」那些瘋狂的腦袋所調製的自釀飲品。醫生不建議飲用。 | A home-brewed drink made from the crazed minds at the Syndicate. Not recommended by doctors.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkEnergyDrinkCan = Red Bool 罐裝 | Red Bool can
    .desc = 一罐「Red Bool」，其中的咖啡因含量多到足以讓一匹馬喪命。 | A can of Red Bool, with enough caffeine to kill a horse.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkShamblersJuiceCan = 蹣跚者果汁 罐 | Shambler's Juice can
    .desc = ~給我來點「蹣跚者果汁」吧！~ | ~Shake me up some of that Shambler's Juice!~
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkPwrGameCan = PWR Game 罐 | PWR Game can
    .desc = 這款飲品蘊含真正玩家夢寐以求的「PWR」。當玩家談論「玩家能量」時，他們所指的正是這款飲品。 | The only drink with the PWR that true gamers crave. When a gamer talks about gamerfuel, this is what they're literally referring to.
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkBeerCan = 啤酒 罐 | beer can
    .desc = 小確幸，大享受，無憂無慮！ | Small joy, big taste, no worries!
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
ent-DrinkWineCan = 葡萄酒 罐 | wine can
    .desc = 讓您忘卻一切煩惱、盡情享受樂趣的絕佳方式！ | Your way to forgetting all worries and having fun!
    .suffix = { ent-DrinkCanBaseFull.suffix }
